8524982}\n# **YOUR PATH TO MASTER GUITAR**\nLearn new exercises, lessons, techniques and songs tailored to your goals and skill level. \n\n{9110577785655427}\n# **PRACTICE AT YOUR SPEED**\nAdjust the speed anytime to learn cool songs or practice your favorite exercises\n\n{1769346543863016}\n# **FOCUS ON WHAT MATTERS**\nSay goodbye to staring at your computer or phone, IMMERROCK lets you focus on what really matters: Your GUITAR and your FINGERS\n\n\ud83c\udfb5 Play your tabs: Convert your tracks and enjoy all the features of IMMERROCK\n\n\u2b50 Stay motivated: Discover new exercises and activities to achieve your goal\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Retain your learning: Develop an intuition and the muscle memory to play anywhere anytime\n\nJoin our Discord Community https://www.discord.gg/SP4tumnEx6\n\n{1342640510088304}\n# Early Access Notice:\n- 6 String Guitars.\n- E Standard tuning. (E A D G B e)\n- We are working on a guitar tuner.\n- We are working on note detection support.", "short_description": "IMMERROCK makes learning guitar easy and approachable, with short exercises, and a clear path so you can MASTER FASTER your guitar."}]}, "developer_name": "IMMERROCK Team", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerrock.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "IMMERROCK Team", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerrock.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_